@startuml starchess-board-entities
' SPEC: _spec/apps/starchess/architecture/board-entities.puml
' purpose: Current-state class entities for apps/starchess board presentation stack
'          (leaves → StarChessBoard → AnimationStage → Live | Static).
!include ../../../themes/proveo.puml

skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam arrowColor #446688
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members

title StarChess · Board presentation entities\n(current)

note as BOUNDARY
  **apps/starchess/public/pieces holds cburnett only.**
  Product boards — live match, review, demos, deploy and
  promotion pickers — render the inline units. A static asset
  is reachable on exactly one branch, `cburnett`, whose sole
  entry point is TutorialScreen's fog-lesson skin toggle.
  Guarded by __tests__/bundle/bundleBoundary.test.ts:
  pieceUrl is importable only from PieceGlyph and
  kingDamageOverlay, and no hand-rolled asset path may appear.
end note

